rums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-31T00:17:46-07:00","id":463177,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FlailBot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/462272-god-machine-merits-and-wolf-blooded?p=462650#post462650\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are we playing the &quot;how many templates can we cram into one PC&quot; game?<br /> <br /> Because if so, please continue. \u263a</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Does only actual templates count? If not, I figured out how to do Sam Haight without breaking any rules:<br /> <br /> Wolf-blood, whatever tell you want, say wolf's meat or anger issues, or maybe both through that merit, can buy dots in totem.<br /> <br /> Become a ghoul of the dead wolf bloodline- can learn protean, can learn the dead wolf discipline that allows one to essentially gain an auspice, and learn the devotion to assume werewolf form.<br /> <br /> Learn cruac from blood donor, or be a member of the sons of phobos, in which case the wolfblooded ghoul can lean cruac anyway, and is compatible with ghouling.<br /> <br /> Learn Blood tenebreous, can shift sideways, and at level five can merge with a spirit. Find a spirit mage, like one of those &quot;angels&quot; from those mages who tend to turn into spirit mages insteads of ghost mages, and voila:<br /> <br /> A wolfblooded ritual magician ghoul who can transform into a wolf, werewolf, human, and near man forms, step sideways, have a totem, cast rotes, and regenerate. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":391,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","user":"StSword","date":". 03-31-2015, 03:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-31T04:35:14-07:00","id":463311,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure that would entirely work. Sublunario only turns you into a wolfman when you frenzy, which ghouls don't do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-31T06:31:07-07:00","id":463400,"title":"","content":"Doesn't really matter that much, with protean 2 and 4 he can assume a wolfman form anyway.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":